<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<section class="mkt-page-hero">
  <h1>Pricing</h1>
  <p class="mkt-lead">Start free. Run the full flooring workspace — sell, deliver, and get paid — before you commit.</p>
</section>

<section class="pricing-grid">
  <article class="price-card price-card-featured">
    <p class="plan-badge">Available now</p>
    <h2>Starter trial</h2>
    <p class="price-line"><span class="price">$0</span> <span class="muted">/ 30 days · no card</span></p>
    <ul class="plan-features">
      <li>Company workspace + subdomain</li>
      <li>Leads, pipeline &amp; customers</li>
      <li>Quotes with Tabela de Valores</li>
      <li>Jobs, schedule &amp; Campo</li>
      <li>Invoices (deposit / custom / full)</li>
      <li>ObraCam photos &amp; ObraChat</li>
      <li>Folha, fluxo &amp; builders pricing</li>
      <li>Team invites &amp; roles</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="btn" href="/signup">Start free trial</a>
  </article>

  <article class="price-card price-card-soon">
    <p class="plan-badge muted-badge">Coming soon</p>
    <h2>Professional</h2>
    <p class="price-line"><span class="price">—</span></p>
    <ul class="plan-features">
      <li>Everything in the trial</li>
      <li>More seats &amp; custom roles</li>
      <li>Priority support</li>
      <li>Billing when you are ready</li>
    </ul>
    <button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" disabled>Coming soon</button>
  </article>

  <article class="price-card price-card-soon">
    <p class="plan-badge muted-badge">Coming soon</p>
    <h2>Business</h2>
    <p class="price-line"><span class="price">—</span></p>
    <ul class="plan-features">
      <li>Everything in Professional</li>
      <li>Higher limits for larger crews</li>
      <li>Advanced reporting</li>
      <li>Guided onboarding</li>
    </ul>
    <button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" disabled>Coming soon</button>
  </article>
</section>

<p class="mkt-fineprint pricing-note">
  Starter is the full product experience during the trial. Paid plans will be announced before anyone is charged.
</p>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
